#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:156
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntNumInput, intChunkSize)
#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:169
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntNumInput, intChunkSize_2)
#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:185
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntNumInput, intNumThreads)
#: rc.cpp:620 rc.cpp:627 rc.cpp:661 rc.cpp:665 rc.cpp:672
msgid ""
"The maximum number of \"tiles\" that are kept in memory. For regular RGBA8 "
"images, each tile is about 16 kB in size. Thus, for a value of 500 tiles "
"this usually means about 8 megabytes are used for image data. If you "
"regularly handle large images, a greater value here might be useful.\n"
"Note that this number is only a guideline for Krita, and is not guaranteed "
"to be the actual number of tiles in memory."
msgstr ""
"De Höögsttall vun \"Kacheln\", de in'n Spieker blifft. Normaal RGBA8-Biller "
"sünd so wat 16 kB groot. Dat bedüüdt, dat för 500 Biller so wat 8MB för de "
"Bilddaten bruukt warrt. Wenn normalerwies mit grote Biller hanteert warrt, "
"is en grötter Weert villicht beter.\n"
"Beacht, dat disse Tall bloots en Hülp för Krita is, un nich de redige Tall "
"vun Kacheln in'n Spieker to wesen bruukt."

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:37
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#: rc.cpp:624
msgid "Maximum number of tiles kept in memory:"
msgstr "Höögsttall vun Kacheln in'n Spieker:"

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:87
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#: rc.cpp:631
msgid ""
"This configures how much Krita will use the swap file. If you move the "
"slider all the way to the left, Krita will not use the swap file at all. If "
"you move it all the way to the right, Krita will make maximum use of the "
"swap file."
msgstr ""
"Dit stellt in, wo faken Krita de Utlagerndatei bruukt. Wenn de Schuver heel "
"na links trocken is, bruukt Krita gor keen Utlagernspieker, heel na rechts "
"warrt de Utlagerndatei op't höögst bruukt."

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:90
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#: rc.cpp:634
msgid "Swappiness:"
msgstr "Utlager-Spiekerbruuk:"

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:97
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSlider, m_swappiness)
#: rc.cpp:637
msgid ""
"This configures how much Krita likes to swap. Move the slider to the left, "
"and there is no swapping at all. Move it to the right there is a lot of "
"swapping going on."
msgstr ""
"Dit stellt in, wo faken Krita de Utlagerndatei bruukt. Wenn de Schuver heel "
"links instellt is, warrt överhööft gor keen Utlagernspieker bruukt. Heel na "
"rechts warrt de Utlagerndatei wedder bannig veel bruukt."

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:118
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_projection)
#: rc.cpp:640
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">If checked, Krita uses "
"more memory but may be faster.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Wenn anmaakt, bruukt Krita "
"mehr Spieker, man is villicht wat gauer.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:121
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_projection)
#: rc.cpp:646
msgid ""
"When Krita uses projections, the results of group layers, effect masks and "
"adjustment layers are cached. This takes a lot of memory but speeds up "
"processing considerably."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Krita Projekschonen bruukt, warrt de Resultaten vun Koppellagen, "
"Effektmasken un Topasslagen twischenspiekert. Dit bruukt veel Spieker, man "
"maakt de Verarbeiden bannig gauer."

#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgperformancesettings.ui:124
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_projection)
#: rc.cpp:649
